16A4 8D16             (       circle.asm):00128                         BSR     DRUN
16A6 962C             (       circle.asm):00129                         LDA     <C_CX           ; left-hand run: cx - half-width ...
16A8 9033             (       circle.asm):00130                         SUBA    <C_HC
